 ("ul", ["Oceans hold most of the planet's water, but it is **salty** and unfit for most land animals, including humans.",
  "**Freshwater** is a very small share, found in glaciers, rivers, lakes, the atmosphere and underground (**groundwater**). This is why there is talk of a *water crisis* despite so much water; saving water at home, school and in the community matters."]),
